# FROGMAN level 1 route, one goal per line (see plan.py for the syntax).
# plan.py finds the key presses for each leg; record.mjs plays them in jsbeeb.
#
# Work in progress: so far this unlocks the map. Still to do: the eight
# terminals and the power terminal.

# The library ticket becomes a bible at the blank tiles on screen (6,1);
# the bible lets the frog through the crosses.
have 2b
have 2c

# Light the candle at the fire on (7,3) and blow up the TNT on (3,3):
# that opens the way down to the bottom row of screens.
have 2c,2f
have 2c,30
event consumed 30

# Wand into the top hat: rabbit. The rabbit clears the barriers on (4,9),
# but there's no headroom to drop anything beyond them, so the bible waits
# on the near side while the rabbit goes through for the white key.
have 2c,34
have 2c,35
at 4,9,6,1
drop 2c at 4,9
have 35,21

# Locked floor (needs the ring) beyond the key: die and start again at home.
at 0,0 deaths=1
